      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BILLY BUST UP (3) hit the frame two on end before being rewarded with a deserved win last time, scoring at Mt Gambier over 400m (22.81). Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from three attempts. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. ZIPPING ALONSO (7) hit the ground running and set it up early last time, clocking 23.27 with a 3 length win at Mt Gambier over 400m and making it back to back wins. In great recent form and expected to measure up again. WEBLEC SHIRALEE (1) turned in a modest effort most recently when sixth at Angle Park over 595m behind Lenny's Honey (35.45) in a Grade 5/6. Was in the money prior to that. Deserves plenty of respect. TOLEDO (5) is worth including.",
